Package: cellstyle
Title: Semantic Scientific Styling for Native ggplot2 Plots
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Nizar", "Batada", email = "nizar.batada@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Composable scientific themes, identity colors, biological replicate
    displays, and supplied statistical annotations for native ggplot2 plots.
    Statistical tests are never selected or computed by annotation helpers.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0), rlang
Suggests: ggbeeswarm, ggrepel
URL: https://github.com/nbatada/cellstyle
BugReports: https://github.com/nbatada/cellstyle/issues
